# Final window (S23 close-out) reference arm = the RECOMMENDED production
# configuration measured on the SHIPPING artifact d209af95 (trimmed O3+O4+O5
# build: same cfg35 wide2 kernel as the measured 7f87e185, losing variants
# removed, fused-quant ops added).  O4's STREAM_MAX_M is deliberately absent:
# it breaks bit-exact greedy parity (docs/result/s23-o6-o3o4-e2e.md).
